%% Immutable artifact transaction and optional publication lifecycle.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Locked: acquire project artifact lock
    Locked --> Staging: create unique job staging directory
    Staging --> Staging: write Markdown, media, diagrams, theme, and render outputs
    Staging --> Validating: build ResourceArtifactManifest
    Validating --> RolledBack: cancellation, missing file, unsafe path, symlink, duplicate, or reserved path
    Validating --> Committing: identity and every declared file validate
    Committing --> RevisionRenamed: atomically rename staging to immutable revision
    RevisionRenamed --> RolledBack: current pointer write fails; remove new revision
    RevisionRenamed --> Current: atomically write current.json
    Current --> Publishing: optional processed PDF destination
    Publishing --> Completed: destination-local atomic rename succeeds
    Publishing --> CompletedWithWarning: publication fails after commit
    Publishing --> Completed: no PDF removes stale published slide resource
    Current --> Completed: no publication requested
    RolledBack --> [*]
    Completed --> [*]
    CompletedWithWarning --> [*]

    note right of Committing
      Existing revisions are immutable.
      current.json is updated only after a complete revision exists.
    end note
